  "abstract": "This is the second experiment in the \"Parsimony and Mastery\" program. Building upon the minimal factorized MLP baseline (ID 226), this submission re-introduces a single component from the SOTA architecture: the ResidualCopyHead (RC). The goal is to isolate and quantify the performance contribution of the RC head in the context of the simplified model.",
